  message: "Diagnosis revised 2026-05-19. Original hypothesis (4 linkers had unmigrated edge-construction code) is incorrect — empirical investigation confirms the 4 linkers filters/emit are migrated correctly to the new framework_role / call_kind / language schema. The actual bug is a single conceptual leak in cli.py: kind=\"table\" overloads SQL CREATE TABLE entities (first-class) with TOML [section] table headers (config noise), and the _is_noise filter drops both. The other three linker 0-edge symptoms are unrelated and turn out to be expected given codebase content (no event-name overlap, no HTTP URL overlap, no GraphQL schemas in repo). Scope tightened to just the SQL table noise-filter fix. Following PR will land the fix and update self-analysis baselines."  # fec4
