  message: "Fixed in PR #3829 (merged 2026-05-19). Root cause: cli.py:_NOISE_KINDS overloaded kind='table' between TOML/INI [section] config noise and SQL CREATE TABLE entities. Fix: removed 'table' from _NOISE_KINDS, added _TABLE_NOISE_LANGUAGES = {toml, ini, properties} carve-out in _is_noise (mirrors existing _CSS_LANGUAGES carve-out for kind='variable'). Self-analysis post-fix: SQL table count 0→1 (users from schema.sql fixture); database-query-linker-v1 edges 0→17. Other 3 linkers (event_sourcing/http/graphql_resolver) remain at 0 edges on self-analysis — confirmed by empirical investigation to be unrelated to the schema migration (no event-name overlap, no HTTP URL overlap, no GraphQL schema files in repo). awaits_bakeoff_validation tag added: a repo with SQL DDL + DB query call-sites should show the database_query edge count restoration vs Apr 23 baseline."  # adcf
